        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Fennel Sextant remote access trojan sample, as reported in campaign PTF-02485. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Fennel Sextant Remote Access Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-02485)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Fennel Sextant Remote Access Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Fennel Sextant remote access trojan in campaign PTF-02485.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"63caf603eaad5902995ba6f630057abc3a8fd6140a51125445bc5b885048e509\", \"a7a786e5920f057b57b68518f14b8bf2ca1d4098c2b504187f9ff04325fe736a\", \"f1b2a3e700f95470188acbdbfb96c10ac6d51333514c195b846d704e5bc849d2\", \"e32072dbbe2820046fe3f4c029c97e88898323dad1e24b5bd76b537c1ac05da6\", \"0054668dc6e8ad5c1f90ae8ca0ad773d2120a47b2d7a2c94d07ce6b09f888030\", \"35838c8f269c30027452307c9cbbaeca990030156fa05a9d1c93015a3cb6e15c\", \"eb5a9160739316dd0e075a8944835d931e4ed95b1f252544ddddb0345ee9bd0c\", \"ea6fd5b9c56879f58e2de01fb7174c50e24b071f8201f1437870aa60ae85ca12\", \"3e44f7f91391f4e8b136975f3a9f625ec5667c68d501d6e7ec8e17acc233895d\", \"bcb67506225201066d4dd101ee4a9fc1c173b63bc0c65c3eb4769d18f7f57ebe\", \"bf065845e136487b7892f4a64d464926d94f8465af41e38cf8274b4fe381d14a\")",
